244.description:
What was so unusual that it took four years to create? Yes, that's how long it took to release the new game. Ori and the Blind Forest, which will be available for testing very soon.

The game's story takes us to a beautiful forest, home to the forest spirit Ori, who protects and defends his domain. But the familiar forest realm begins to fill us with anxiety due to various changes. The player must journey from a peaceful forest spirit to a merciless warrior capable of defending his lands. Overall, the game promises to be captivating. Verdict: Download the game. Ori and the Blind Forest Anyone who loves high-quality platformers needs this via torrent.

And a little about the features on PC:
The secret to the game's long development is that the developers decided to create a unique world by hand – to draw every leaf on the tree, every butterfly wing, to create a unique world!
- but it wasn’t just the picture that received special attention; a whole orchestra was involved in recording the game’s soundtrack;
- such colossal efforts spent on the image and voice acting should extend to the plot...

Repack features:
- Nothing cut / nothing re-encoded;
- Option not to download the bonus video (bonus_video.bin);
